{
  "book": "Psa", "book_id": 19, "chapter": 49, "provenance": "reread-psalms-2026",
  "note": "Ps49 wisdom on riches+mortality (corrected method). Human IB: chokmah/tevunah/hagut/lev the teacher's wisdom, yare not-fear (of wealth/death), fool's batach trust-in-wealth / halal boast / kesel foolish-confidence / barak self-blessing, universal death (chakam/kesil/baar all die, azab leave wealth), nefesh soul x3 (costly ransom v8 / God ransoms v15 / goes to fathers v18). Only 1 God-act (padah ransom v15) = qualifier. Riches/glory = standalone. Every candidate roled.",
  "spans": {
    "279379": {"gloss":"wisdom v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wisdom (chokmah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the psalmist","to":279379,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"speak","to":279379,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the heart's understanding","from":279379,"to":279382,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My mouth shall speak WISDOM (chokmah); the meditation of my heart shall be understanding' — the teacher's inner store of wisdom overflowing into speech; chokmah (recurs Ps37:30) the skilled insight the psalmist offers all peoples, high and low, rich and poor"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279380": {"gloss":"meditation v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"meditation / musing (hagut)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (its musing)","from":279380,"to":279381,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the psalmist","to":279380,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"of the heart, yielding understanding","from":279380,"to":279382,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the MEDITATION (hagut) of my heart shall be understanding' — the inner musing that produces wisdom; hagut the reflective pondering of the heart, the deep thought from which the proverb and riddle come"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279381": {"gloss":"heart v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":279381,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the psalmist","to":279381,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"whose meditation is understanding","from":279381,"to":279380,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the meditation of my HEART (lev)' — the heart as the workshop of wisdom; lev here the seat of the reflective musing that becomes understanding, the source of the sage's teaching"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279382": {"gloss":"understanding v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"understanding / insight (tevunah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the psalmist","to":279382,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with spoken wisdom","from":279382,"to":279379,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'shall be UNDERSTANDING (tevunah)' — the discernment the heart's meditation yields; tevunah the insight paired with wisdom, the fruit of pondering the riddle of wealth and death"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279384": {"gloss":"fear v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"fear (yare, rhetorical negation)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the psalmist","to":279384,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"fear (rhetorically none)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the cheaters' iniquity","from":279384,"to":279387,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"in times of trouble","to":279384,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"rhetorically none ('Why should I FEAR?')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Why should I FEAR (yare) in times of trouble, when the iniquity of those who cheat me surrounds me?' — fearlessness before the wealthy oppressor; yare here the dread the wise refuses, since the rich cannot ransom themselves from death (the psalm's answer to fear)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279387": {"gloss":"iniquity v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity (avon - of those who cheat)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"those who cheat/supplant","to":279387,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"surround","to":279387,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the psalmist","to":279387,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the iniquity the psalmist need not fear","from":279387,"to":279384,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the INIQUITY (avon) of those who cheat me surrounds me' — the encircling wickedness of the supplanters; avon here the iniquity of the wealthy defrauders whose menace the wise sees through, knowing their end"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279391": {"gloss":"trust v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"trust (batach - in wealth)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the rich (who cheat)","to":279391,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"trust"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"their wealth","to":279391,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with boasting of riches","from":279391,"to":279393,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'those who TRUST (batach) in their wealth and boast of their riches' — misplaced confidence in possessions; batach (recurs widely, usually of trust in God) here darkly inverted — the fool's reliance on wealth that cannot ransom him from death"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279393": {"gloss":"boast v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"boast (halal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the rich","to":279393,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"boast"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the abundance of their riches","to":279393,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with trusting in wealth","from":279393,"to":279391,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and BOAST (halal) of the abundance of their riches' — glorying in wealth; halal (contrast the right boasting in God, Ps34:2) here the fool's self-glory in riches, the vaunting that death exposes as folly"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279399": {"gloss":"ransom v7","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"ransom / redeem (padah - no man can, negated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"no man (unable)","to":279399,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"ransom (negated)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"another (his brother)","to":279399,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"emphatic ('truly')","from":279399,"to":279396,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"negated ('NO man can ransom another')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Truly no man can RANSOM (padah) another, or give to God the price of his life' — the impotence of wealth before death; padah negated, no human ransom can buy off the grave — the great equaliser the rich forget"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279406": {"gloss":"life v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul / life (nefesh - ransom of their life)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":279406,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"any man (his life unransomable)","to":279406,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"costly, can never suffice","to":279406,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'for the ransom of their LIFE (nefesh) is costly and can never suffice' — the priceless, unbuyable soul; nefesh (first of three, v8,15,18) the life no wealth can redeem from the pit, beyond all human price"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279273": {"gloss":"wise v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wise (chakam)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wise (who also die)","to":279273,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"die","to":279273,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the fool and stupid","from":279273,"to":279275,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'For he sees that even the WISE (chakam) die' — death levels even wisdom; chakam here the wise who, no less than the fool, must die and leave their wealth — mortality the common lot"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279275": {"gloss":"fool v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"fool (kesil)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the fool","to":279275,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"perish","to":279275,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the wise and the stupid","from":279275,"to":279276,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the FOOL (kesil) and the stupid alike must perish' — the dullard's death alongside the wise; kesil the thick-headed fool who, with the wise, leaves his wealth to others"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279276": {"gloss":"stupid v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"stupid / brutish (baar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the brutish","to":279276,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the fool","from":279276,"to":279275,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the fool and the STUPID (baar) alike must perish' — the brutish/animal-like senseless; baar the beast-like stupidity (echoing 'like the beasts that perish', v12,20), perishing and leaving wealth behind"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279279": {"gloss":"leave v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"leave / abandon (azab - wealth to others)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the dying (wise and fool)","to":279279,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"leave behind"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"their wealth (to others)","to":279279,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and LEAVE (azab) their wealth to others' — the futility of hoarding; azab here the forced abandonment of wealth at death, the riches passing to strangers — possessions that cannot follow"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279290": {"gloss":"called v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"call / name (qara - lands by their names)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the wealthy","to":279290,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"call / name"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"lands (by their own names)","to":279290,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'though they CALLED (qara) lands by their own names' — the vain bid for lasting memory; qara here the naming of estates after oneself to perpetuate one's name, though the grave is the only home that lasts forever"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279302": {"gloss":"foolish v13","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"foolish confidence / folly (kesel)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"those of foolish confidence","to":279302,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"whose boasts people approve","from":279302,"to":279304,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'This is the path of those who have FOOLISH confidence (kesel)' — the self-assured folly that trusts in wealth; kesel here the misplaced confidence/stupidity of the rich, a way that ends in the grave yet is admired by those who follow"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279304": {"gloss":"approve v13","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be pleased with / approve (ratsah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the people who follow","to":279304,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"approve"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"their boasts","to":279304,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"of the foolishly confident","from":279304,"to":279302,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'yet after them people APPROVE (ratsah) of their boasts' — the crowd's endorsement of the fool's vaunting; ratsah here the misguided approval that perpetuates the folly, each generation admiring the boasts of the doomed rich"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279313": {"gloss":"upright v14","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"upright (yashar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the upright","to":279313,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"rule over them (in the morning)","to":279313,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the doomed rich","to":279313,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'the UPRIGHT (yashar) shall rule over them in the morning' — the final reversal, the just prevailing over the rich consigned to Sheol; yashar (recurs widely) the upright whose dawn-triumph answers the death-shepherded wealthy"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279323": {"gloss":"soul v15","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul / life (nefesh - God ransoms my soul)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":279323,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the psalmist","to":279323,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"ransomed from Sheol by God (v15)","from":279323,"to":279322,"res":"span"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"from the power of Sheol","to":279323,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'But God will ransom my SOUL (nefesh) from the power of Sheol, for he will receive me' — the great 'but': the soul no man could ransom (v8), God will (v15); nefesh (second of three) the life God redeems from death, the believer's hope against the fate of the rich — God's ransoming is the qualifier"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279331": {"gloss":"afraid v16","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be afraid (yare, negated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the hearer","to":279331,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"be afraid (deprecated)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"when a man becomes rich","to":279331,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"deprecated ('Be NOT afraid when a man becomes rich')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Be not AFRAID (yare) when a man becomes rich, when the glory of his house increases' — the counsel against envy/dread of the wealthy; yare (recurs v5) negated again — no need to fear the rich, for they carry nothing away in death"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279350": {"gloss":"he/soul v18","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"soul / self (nefesh - he counts himself blessed)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":279350,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the rich man","to":279350,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"while he lives","to":279350,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"counts itself blessed","from":279350,"to":279352,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'though, while he lives, he counts himself (nefesh) blessed' — the self-congratulating soul of the rich; nefesh (third of three) the self that blesses itself in prosperity, yet goes down to the fathers who never see light (v19)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279352": {"gloss":"blessed v18","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"bless / count blessed (barak - himself)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the rich man","to":279352,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"count blessed"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"himself (his soul)","from":279352,"to":279350,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"of the self","from":279352,"to":279350,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'he counts himself BLESSED (barak)' — self-congratulation in prosperity; barak here reflexive — the rich man blessing his own soul, the smug self-satisfaction that death will silence"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279353": {"gloss":"praise v18","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"praise / give thanks (yadah - you get praise)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"others (praising the prosperous)","to":279353,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"praise"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the one who does well for himself","to":279353,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and though you get PRAISE (yadah) when you do well for yourself' — the world's applause for the self-serving prosperous; yadah here the praise men give the successful, hollow flattery that cannot follow him past death (v19)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279373": {"gloss":"understanding v20","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"understand / discern (bin, negated)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"man in his pomp (lacking it)","to":279373,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"absent ('without UNDERSTANDING')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Man in his pomp yet without UNDERSTANDING (bin) is like the beasts that perish' — the refrain: splendour without discernment is bestial; bin absent (contrast the psalmist's understanding, v3) — the man who will not grasp his mortality dies like an animal"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "279322": {"gloss":"ransom v15 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"ransom / redeem (padah - God will ransom)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"the ransom of the psalmist's soul from Sheol (v15)","from":279322,"to":279323,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v15 QUALIFIER (God's act): 'But God will RANSOM (padah) my soul from the power of Sheol' - God's redeeming is not a human IB char; it is the deliverance of the psalmist's soul (279323) that no man could achieve (v7-8). Qualifier - the great contrast to human helplessness."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "279396": {"gloss":"Truly v7 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"ransom (padah, infinitive-absolute = 'truly/surely')"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"emphatic doubling of the ransom-verb (279399)","from":279396,"to":279399,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v7: the infinitive-absolute 'TRULY/surely' (padah doubled) intensifying 'no man can ransom' (279399); an emphatic qualifier of the ransom-verb. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "279263": {"gloss":"Hear v1 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hear (shama - Hear this, all peoples)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v1: 'HEAR (shama) this, all peoples!' - the wisdom-teacher's summons to attention; the call to listen preceding the instruction. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279267": {"gloss":"Give ear v1 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"give ear / attend (azan - all inhabitants)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v1: 'GIVE EAR (azan), all inhabitants of the world!' - the parallel summons to attend the teaching; the call to listen. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279368": {"gloss":"poor v2 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"poor / needy (evyon - rich and poor)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v2: 'both low and high, rich and POOR (evyon) together' - the naming of the universal audience (all social classes) addressed by the wisdom; a social category, not an inner operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279386": {"gloss":"trouble v5 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"trouble / evil (ra - times of trouble)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v5: 'Why should I fear in times of TROUBLE (ra)' - the evil days/circumstance in which fear might arise; the setting of the fearlessness (279384). Standalone/circumstance."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279392": {"gloss":"wealth v6 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wealth / power (chayil)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v6: 'those who trust in their WEALTH (chayil)' - the riches trusted in; the object of the fool's trust (279391), a possession, not an inner operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279404": {"gloss":"life-price v7 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"ransom-price (kofer - price of his life)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v7: 'or give to God the PRICE of his life (kofer)' - the ransom-price no man can pay; the impossible sum, an object of the failed ransom (279399). Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279409": {"gloss":"live v9 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"live / continue (chayah - live on forever)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v9: 'that he should LIVE on (chayah) forever and never see the pit' - the impossible endless life the ransom cannot buy; a state, not an inner operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279281": {"gloss":"wealth v10 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wealth (chayil - left to others)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v10: 'and leave their WEALTH (chayil) to others' - the riches abandoned at death; the object of the leaving (279279), a possession. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279285": {"gloss":"forever v11 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"forever (olam - graves their homes forever)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v11: 'Their graves are their homes FOREVER (olam)' - the grim permanence of the tomb; a time-word (the only 'forever' the rich attain), not an inner operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279292": {"gloss":"names v11 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"names (shem - lands by their names)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v11: 'though they called lands by their own NAMES (shem)' - the names the rich attach to estates; the object of the vain self-naming (279290). Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279336": {"gloss":"glory v16 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"glory / wealth (kavod - glory of his house)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v16: 'when the GLORY (kavod) of his house increases' - the outward splendour/wealth of the rich man's house; outward magnificence, not an inner operation (per the glory=standalone rule). Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279345": {"gloss":"glory v17 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"glory / wealth (kavod - will not go down)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v17: 'his GLORY (kavod) will not go down after him' - the outward wealth/splendour that death strips away; outward magnificence, not an inner operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "279354": {"gloss":"well v18 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"do well / prosper (yatab)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v18: 'when you do WELL (yatab) for yourself' - the prospering/self-benefiting that draws praise (279353); an outward doing-well, not an inner operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]}
  }
}
